    <!-- Quickspace PSA - Custom messages for the glance -->
    <string name="quickspace_psa_title">Random messages</string>
    <string name="quickspace_psa_summary">Make your companion more lively with random messages</string>

    <string-array name="quickspace_psa_morning">
        <item>Good morning! The bed misses you, but the day needs you.</item>
        <item>Coffee first, adulting second.</item>
        <item>Rise and shine. Or just rise, shining is optional.</item>
        <item>Your alarm called. It wants an apology.</item>
        <item>Five more minutes is how this whole mess started.</item>
        <item>Today\'s forecast: 100 percent chance of getting things done. Probably.</item>
        <item>You woke up. That\'s already a win.</item>
        <item>Breakfast is the most important meal. So is lunch. And dinner.</item>
        <item>The sun is up, so unfortunately you have to be too.</item>
        <item>Good morning! Please hold while your brain loads.</item>
        <item>Be the person your phone\'s battery thinks you are at 100 percent.</item>
        <item>New day, same you, slightly better hair. Maybe.</item>
        <item>Let\'s get this bread.</item>
        <item>Remember: nobody is a morning person, some just hide it well.</item>
        <item>Stretch. Your spine says thanks.</item>
        <item>Woke up and chose to miss someone. Anyone, really.</item>
        <item>Good morning to everyone except the one who left me on read.</item>
        <item>Another sunrise, another day of not getting a reply.</item>
    </string-array>
    <string-array name="quickspace_psa_noon">
        <item>Is it lunch yet? It\'s always lunch somewhere.</item>
        <item>Your stomach filed a complaint. Please respond.</item>
        <item>Productivity is down 40 percent. Snacks are the only known fix.</item>
        <item>Pretend you\'re busy, the afternoon is long.</item>
        <item>Drink some water. Coffee does not count.</item>
        <item>Half the day is gone and so is your to-do list. Wait, no.</item>
        <item>A nap now is a performance optimization.</item>
        <item>You\'re doing better than your inbox thinks.</item>
        <item>Just one more video. Said every hour since morning.</item>
        <item>Reminder: you have legs. Stand up for a minute.</item>
        <item>Lunch break: the only meeting you never skip.</item>
        <item>If it\'s not on fire, it can wait until after lunch.</item>
        <item>Buffering motivation... 99 percent... 99 percent... 99 percent...</item>
        <item>You look great. Whatever you did, keep doing it.</item>
        <item>Today\'s mood: out of office, but physically present.</item>
        <item>Still checking if they replied. Spoiler: no.</item>
        <item>Lunch for one, hope for none.</item>
        <item>Your crush saw your story and said nothing. Classic.</item>
    </string-array>
    <string-array name="quickspace_psa_early_evening">
        <item>Almost home time. Hold on a little longer.</item>
        <item>Traffic is just everybody telling you to take it slow.</item>
        <item>Your couch has been waiting all day. Loyal friend.</item>
        <item>Time to ask the eternal question: what\'s for dinner?</item>
        <item>Golden hour. Perfect lighting for a photo you\'ll never post.</item>
        <item>Another day survived. Pat yourself on the back.</item>
        <item>Snack o\'clock, the unofficial hour before dinner.</item>
        <item>Your phone is at 20 percent. So is your patience.</item>
        <item>Plot twist: you did more today than you think.</item>
        <item>Go outside for five minutes. The sky is showing off.</item>
        <item>Nobody is checking your email now. Probably.</item>
        <item>Dinner plans: yes, please, and with rice.</item>
        <item>You\'re not tired, you\'re just buffering in high quality.</item>
        <item>Take off your shoes. Freedom is a small thing.</item>
        <item>Sunset looks better when someone is not ignoring you.</item>
        <item>Evening is when the feelings start to wake up.</item>
        <item>Not sad, just professionally nostalgic.</item>
    </string-array>
    <string-array name="quickspace_psa_evening">
        <item>The couch, the blanket, and nothing else. Perfect.</item>
        <item>Just one episode. Said nobody ever, and meant it.</item>
        <item>Your bed is a better friend than your alarm.</item>
        <item>Netflix asks if you\'re still watching. Yes. Leave us alone.</item>
        <item>Stay hydrated. Yes, again.</item>
        <item>Late night snacks have zero calories if nobody sees them.</item>
        <item>Plan for tomorrow: figure it out tomorrow.</item>
        <item>Evening mode: dark theme and bad decisions.</item>
        <item>Today\'s achievements: you exist. Great job.</item>
        <item>Silence your notifications. They are not your boss.</item>
        <item>Dinner is over, so snacks are legally a new meal.</item>
        <item>The scroll is endless, but your sleep isn\'t.</item>
        <item>Be kind to yourself. You did fine today.</item>
        <item>Charging your phone? Don\'t forget to charge yourself too.</item>
        <item>Playing sad songs and calling it self-care.</item>
        <item>Typed a long message. Deleted it. Typed it again. Deleted it again.</item>
        <item>They are online, but not for you. Breathe.</item>
    </string-array>
    <string-array name="quickspace_psa_midnight">
        <item>Go to sleep. The memes will still be there tomorrow.</item>
        <item>It\'s late. Your future self is already annoyed.</item>
        <item>Why is it that the best ideas arrive at 2 AM?</item>
        <item>Your pillow has been calling you. It sounds worried.</item>
        <item>Sleep is free and the best upgrade you can get.</item>
        <item>Still awake? Same. We\'re in this together.</item>
        <item>Let\'s pretend you\'re checking something important.</item>
        <item>Nothing good happens after 2 AM, except snacks.</item>
        <item>Tomorrow you\'ll say you\'ll sleep early. We both know.</item>
        <item>The fridge light is not a flashlight, but here we are.</item>
        <item>Just one more scroll. Famous last words.</item>
        <item>Your eyes need rest. Your phone doesn\'t care, but they do.</item>
        <item>You can\'t fix everything tonight. Blame the hour.</item>
        <item>Brain at 3 AM: remember that thing from 2014?</item>
        <item>It\'s 2 AM and you\'re thinking about that one text from last year.</item>
        <item>Who needs sleep when you have unresolved feelings?</item>
        <item>Their last seen says it all, and it says nothing.</item>
        <item>Midnight thoughts: why did I say that in 2019?</item>
    </string-array>
    <string-array name="quickspace_psa_random">
        <item>Oh hey, what\'s up?</item>
        <item>Is it time to flash another update already?</item>
        <item>How many screenshots do you take, honestly?</item>
        <item>Time for some good music.</item>
        <item>Have you tried turning it off and on again?</item>
        <item>I\'m a launcher, not a therapist, but go on.</item>
        <item>Remember to check your battery. Or don\'t, live dangerously.</item>
        <item>You can disable this chatter in home settings. But why would you?</item>
        <item>Loading witty message... please wait... still loading...</item>
        <item>This message is brought to you by your own phone.</item>
        <item>Back up your data. Seriously. Do it now.</item>
        <item>No, I will not tell you your screen time.</item>
        <item>Your phone has 99 problems and none of them are battery. Wait.</item>
        <item>Fun fact: you just looked at your phone again.</item>
        <item>Do something nice for someone today. Or at least for your snacks.</item>
        <item>Say hi to us on Telegram.</item>
        <item>Could AI take your job? Not before it learns to like rice.</item>
        <item>Please do not eat your phone. It is not a snack.</item>
        <item>Bug? That\'s a feature. Report it kindly.</item>
        <item>Everything is fine. The ROM is fine. You are fine.</item>
        <item>Galau is just a feeling with a really bad Wi-Fi signal.</item>
        <item>I\'m fine. Totally fine. Please don\'t check my playlist.</item>
        <item>Heartbreak is temporary. Screenshots are forever.</item>
        <item>Left on read, but the launcher still replies. Hi.</item>
        <item>Not single, just in a long-distance relationship with the ones who never text back.</item>
    </string-array>
